                                "sense_id": "a6e03f79-9eac-30e0-b1d8-1f64accf3649",
                                "text": "From the Celeste's own image was the first castling molded. A soft, delicate creature of flesh and blood she would call Woman. So that Her castlings may never feel the loneliness she Herself did suffer, she bestowed woman with a mate [...]"
                            }
                        ]
